NOTICE ON PROVENANCE

slinkyFX is built using reverse-engineered, decompiled and recovered code from slinky,
which Skid Solutions sourced. That foundation is not original work, and credit and
recognition for it belong to Skid Solutions.

The MIT grant below applies to the parts of this repository that slinkyFX wrote: the
loader (Slinky/), the native engine (SlinkyNative/src/engine/) and the build tooling and
documentation. It does not apply to, and this project does not claim to license, the
recovered slinky code it is built on, which carries no license of its own. Nothing here
grants any right to slinky or to its code. Credit for the recovered foundation: Skid Solutions.

